{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26094","headline":"秋暮八月十五夜与王璠侍御赏月因怆远离聊以奉寄 · 鲍溶","name":"秋暮八月十五夜与王璠侍御赏月因怆远离聊以奉寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前月月明夜，美人同远光。\n清尘一以间，今夕坐相忘。\n风落芙蓉露，凝余绣服香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}